SCOPE

The MIT License above covers the code in this repository: the build scripts
(scripts/), the calendar function (api/), the stylesheet and browser scripts
(styles.css, *.js), and the configuration structure.

It does NOT cover the William Walker Elementary PTC's own content, which
remains all rights reserved:

  - the written copy in src/pages/ and content/
  - the generated HTML pages built from that copy
  - everything in assets/, including the logo, photographs, flyers and
    sponsor logos
  - the names "William Walker Elementary" and "William Walker PTC"

To start a site for another school, replace that content with your own.
docs/forking.md explains how.
